      "createdAt": "2026-09-13T00:00:00.000Z",
      "createdBy": "fixture-converter",
      "data": {
        "description": "Claude Monet, also known as Oscar-Claude Monet or Claude Oscar Monet was born to Adolphe and Louise-Justine Monet of 45 Rue Laffitte, in the 9th arrondissement of Paris. He was christened as Oscar-Claude at the church of Notre-Dame-de-Lorette. His father wanted him to go into the family (grocery store) business, but Claude Monet wanted to become an artist. His mother was a singer, both parents were second-generation Parisians."
      },
      "deletedAt": null,
      "end": null,
      "extensions": {
        "sourceRecord": {
          "description": "Claude Monet, also known as Oscar-Claude Monet or Claude Oscar Monet was born to Adolphe and Louise-Justine Monet of 45 Rue Laffitte, in the 9th arrondissement of Paris. He was christened as Oscar-Claude at the church of Notre-Dame-de-Lorette. His father wanted him to go into the family (grocery store) business, but Claude Monet wanted to become an artist. His mother was a singer, both parents were second-generation Parisians.",
